Govee Local Scenes
Copyright 2026 casi-3

This project contains a modified copy of the "govee_light_local" integration
from Home Assistant Core (https://github.com/home-assistant/core),
Copyright the Home Assistant authors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Modifications by casi-3:
- added scene_library.py (scene catalog, LAN scene encoding)
- light.py: effect list and effect handling use the scene catalog
- manifest.json: custom integration metadata and version
- catalogs/: bundled scene catalogs

The scene packet encoding follows the description published in
govee2mqtt (https://github.com/wez/govee2mqtt, MIT License).

The H60A6-specific A3/A4 framing is based on the app-derived implementation in
govee-ble-local (https://github.com/Brady-Woods/govee-ble-local),
Copyright (c) 2026 Brady Woods, licensed under the MIT License.
